{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22131","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 二 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翳翳踰月阴，沈沈连日雨。\n开帘望天色，黄云暗如土。\n行潦毁我墉，疾风坏我宇。\n蓬莠生庭院，泥涂失场圃。\n村深绝宾客，窗晦无俦侣。\n尽日不下牀，跳蛙时入户。\n出门无所往，入室还独处。\n不以酒自娱，块然与谁语。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}